{"id": 2214, "title": "I got angry today", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "i-was-pissed-off-today", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2214_i-was-pissed-off-today.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的男朋友今天早上说，晚上我们一起吃饭，因为他想给我过生日。我有点儿生气，因为我的生日不是今天，下个星期才是我的生日。他知道我不高兴，就告诉我，因为下个星期他要去北京，不能给我过生日。他又说，去公司旁边的饭馆吃饭。我更生气了，因为那个饭馆的菜都是我非常不喜欢的。我问他为什么，他说因为很近，很方便。我现在一点儿也不想和他见面了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的男朋友今天早上說，晚上我們一起吃飯，因為他想給我過生日。我有點兒生氣，因為我的生日不是今天，下個星期才是我的生日。他知道我不高興，就告訴我，因為下個星期他要去北京，不能給我過生日。他又說，去公司旁邊的飯館吃飯。我更生氣了，因為那個飯館的菜都是我非常不喜歡的。我問他為什麼，他說因為很近，很方便。我現在一點兒也不想和他見面了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de nán péng you jīn tiān zǎo shang shuō， wǎn shang wǒ men yī qǐ chī fàn， yīn wèi tā xiǎng gěi wǒ guò shēng rì。 wǒ yǒu diǎn r shēng qì， yīn wèi wǒ de shēng rì bù shì jīn tiān， xià gè xīng qī cái shì wǒ de shēng rì。 tā zhī dào wǒ bù gāo xìng， jiù gào su wǒ， yīn wèi xià gè xīng qī tā yào qù Běi jīng， bù néng gěi wǒ guò shēng rì。 tā yòu shuō， qù gōng sī páng biān de fàn guǎn chī fàn。 wǒ gèng shēng qì le， yīn wèi nà gè fàn guǎn de cài dōu shì wǒ fēi cháng bù xǐ huan de。 wǒ wèn tā wèi shén me， tā shuō yīn wèi hěn jìn， hěn fāng biàn。 wǒ xiàn zài yī diǎn r yě bù xiǎng hé tā jiàn miàn le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["This morning, my boyfriend said we would have dinner together tonight because he wanted to celebrate my birthday. I was a little upset because my birthday isn’t today—it’s next week. He could tell I wasn’t happy, so he explained that he had to go to Beijing next week and wouldn’t be able to celebrate with me then. He also said we’d eat at the restaurant next to his office. That made me even angrier because I really don’t like any of the food there. I asked him why he’d chosen it, and he said it was close and convenient. Now I don’t want to see him at all."], "english_full": "This morning, my boyfriend said we would have dinner together tonight because he wanted to celebrate my birthday. I was a little upset because my birthday isn’t today—it’s next week. He could tell I wasn’t happy, so he explained that he had to go to Beijing next week and wouldn’t be able to celebrate with me then. He also said we’d eat at the restaurant next to his office. That made me even angrier because I really don’t like any of the food there. I asked him why he’d chosen it, and he said it was close and convenient. Now I don’t want to see him at all.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nán\" data-defn=\"(bound form) male\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">男</span><span class=\"tr\">男</span><rt>nán</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīn tiān\" data-defn=\"today\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zǎo shang\" data-defn=\"early morning\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shang</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǎn shang\" data-defn=\"in the evening\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shang</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ men\" data-defn=\"we; us; ourselves; our\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">